          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{dy}{dx}&=2-\\frac{e^x}{1+e^x}\\\\&=\\frac{2(1+e^x)-e^x}{1+e^x}\\\\&=\\frac{2+e^x}{1+e^x}\\end{align*}$$"
